# AWS resource changes

When adding or deepening AWS resources, connections, emitters, or materializers:

1. Read `docs/aws-coverage.md`
2. Follow `.cursor/skills/add-aws-resource/SKILL.md`
3. Update coverage in the same change
4. Prefer claiming a GitHub Project item / issue and opening a PR with `Fixes #N`

See `AGENTS.md` for the full agent workflow.
